<ul>
    <li>This project allows employees to apply for leave in an easy and organized way.</li>

    <li>Employees can submit leave requests by entering leave dates and a reason.</li>

    <li>Employees can view their leave requests and check the current status.</li>

    <li>Admin can review all leave requests and approve or reject them.</li>

    <li>The system reduces manual work and helps keep all leave records in one place.</li>
</ul>